# ==============================================================================
# ConnectomeToBehaviour — .gitignore
# ==============================================================================

# --- Large Connectome Datasets (Exceeds GitHub 100MB limit) ---
*.parquet
*.feather
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pickle
*.pkl
*.npy
*.npz
data/
*.csv

# --- Third-Party / Forked Reference Repositories ---
# (Kept locally for reference and data, but not tracked in this repository)
Drosophila_brain_model-main/
fly-brain/
Turagalab-flybody/

# --- Simulation Run Outputs & Cache ---
results/*
!results/validation/
logs/
*.log

# --- Python & Brian2 Build Caches ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.brian/

# --- Environments ---
.env
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/

# --- IDE & OS Metadata ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.tmp

# --- Fresh rebuild run outputs (Part 3 freeze, 23 Nov 2026) ---
# Run directories under fresh/runs/ are uncommitted run output by design
# (PART3-FREEZE.md): a run's provenance lives in its manifest, not in git.
# Ignoring the directory keeps `git status` honest for the preregistration's
# clean-tree requirement (PART3-PREREG.md section 5).
fresh/runs/
